SUMMARY:CRITICAL REFLEX TIME: October 20\, 2026
DESCRIPTION:CRITICAL REFLEX will host a CRITICAL REFLEX TIME broadcast on October 20 at 10:30 a.m. PT / 1:30 p.m. ET. You will be able to watch it on YouTube. \nThe broadcast will feature more announcements following CRITICAL REFLEX’s appearance at the ID@Xbox Showcase.
URL:https://www.gematsu.com/event/critical-reflex-time-october-20-2026
