SUMMARY:INDIE Live Expo: December 1\, 2026
DESCRIPTION:Ryu’s Office will host INDIE Live Expo on December 1 at 2:00 a.m. PT / 5:00 a.m. ET / 18:00 JST. You will be able to watch it on YouTube (English\, Japanese\, Korean)\, Twitch (English\, Japanese)\, Twitter (English\, Japanese\, Korean)\, and TikTok. \nThe broadcast will highlight “2027’s must-have indie titles\,” featuring “dozens” of announcements including world premieres\, content updates\, surprises launches\, and more during the signature INDIE Waves segment. \nThe annual INDIE Live Expo award ceremony will bestow honors upon critically acclaimed titles\, selected by prominent figures from across the games industry.
URL:https://www.gematsu.com/event/indie-live-expo-december-1-2026
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://www.gematsu.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/Event_ILE-Inits_12-01-26.jpg
END:VEVENT
