SUMMARY:The Game Awards 2026
DESCRIPTION:The Game Awards 2026 will be held on December 10 at 4:30 p.m. PT / 7:30 p.m. ET at Peacock Theater in Los Angeles\, California. You will be able to watch it on YouTube. \nMore details to come.
